<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17050" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτεχν-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without art, unskilful,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				274c
			</span></i>; esp. <i>ignorant of the rules</i> or <i>principles of
				art,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔντεχνος</span> or
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεχνίτης,</span>
			<i>unskilled, unprofessional,</i> of persons, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				219a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.134
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				3.262
			</span></i>; <i>having no trade</i> or <i>profession,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PFlor.
				4.14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>; <i>unsystematic,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διδασκαλία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anon.
					<u>in SE</u>
					67.31
				</span></i>
			; of pursuits, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. τριβή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					260e
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				262c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				938a
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίστεις ἄ.</span> proofs
				<i>not invented by the orator,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1355b35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1375a22
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδείξεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.355
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσχρὸν καὶ ἄ.</span>”
				<i>not workmanlike,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Fract.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ</span>
			<i>uncreative,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεχνικόν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Zeno Stoic.
				1.34
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαντασία</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.24
			</span></i>.</div>
